      "source": [
        "# Power\n",
        "\n",
        "`**` raises its left operand to the power of its right operand. It groups right to left and interacts specially with unary operators.\n",
        "\n"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "id": "d5f352b6a693fb8d",
      "metadata": {
      },
      "source": [
        "2 ** 3 ** 2  # 512\n",
        "2 ** -1  # 0.5\n"
      ],
